# API Contract — Program Detail
## 1. Endpoint Summary

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose | Authentication | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ``/programs/{program_id}/detail`` | GET | Get full program structure (weeks, days, workouts) | Required | Used by Program Detail screen |
| ``/programs/{program_id}/day/{day_id}`` | GET | Get detail for a specific program day | Required | Used when user taps a specific day |
| ``/programs/{program_id}/workout/{workout_id}`` | GET | Get workout detail (exercises) | Required | Used by Workout Detail screen |

## 2. Response Schemas
