## 3. Validation Rules
**Program Detail**  
- Program must exist
- Program must be active
- User must have access to the program (public or assigned)

**Program Day Detail**  
- Day must belong to the program
- Day must exist
- Workout must exist
- Workout Detail
- Workout must belong to the program
- Workout must exist

## 4. Business Rules
**Program Structure**  
- Programs are structured as:
 - Weeks
 - Days
 - Workouts
 - Exercises

**Completion Status**
- is_completed is derived from workout logs
- A day is completed if its workout is completed
- A week is completed if all days are completed

**Workout Detail**
- Exercises include:
 - Strength (sets/reps/weight)
 - Cardio (duration/distance)
 - Interval (rounds/time)

**Program Detail Screen**
- UI uses this endpoint to render:
 - Week cards
 - Day tiles
 - Workout preview

## 5. Error Model

| HTTP Code | Error Code | Message | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 400 | ``INVALID_REQUEST`` | Missing or invalid fields | Validation failure |
| 401 | ``UNAUTHORIZED`` | Invalid or missing token | Auth required |
| 404 | ``PROGRAM_NOT_FOUND`` | Program not found | Invalid ID |
| 404 | ``DAY_NOT_FOUND`` | Day not found | Invalid day ID |
| 404 | ``WORKOUT_NOT_FOUND`` | Workout not found | Invalid workout ID |
| 500 | ``SERVER_ERROR`` | Internal error | Unexpected failure |

