## 7. Notes / Edge Cases
- Programs may have variable numbers of days per week
- Some programs may include optional days
- Exercises may include:
 - weight
 - reps
 - sets
 - duration
 - distance
- Program detail does not include user‑specific progress — that comes from Dashboard